---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <section class="py-24 px-8 text-center">
    <h1 class="text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-charcoal mb-6">Building businesses.<br/>Creating possibilities.</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-subtle-grey mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Quintana & Co. is a family-owned company building businesses, brands, and future investments with a long-term view.</p>
    <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center">
        <Button text="Explore Our Businesses" href="/businesses" />
        <Button text="Our Story" variant="secondary" href="/our-story" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 px-8 bg-ivory text-center">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-charcoal mb-6">Different businesses. One family. One long-term vision.</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-charcoal max-w-3xl mx-auto">Chris and Vianca Quintana are building a portfolio of businesses and future investments shaped by family, experience, and a long-term perspective. What began as an entrepreneurial journey has grown into a broader vision: create businesses, build assets, and create opportunities that can extend beyond one generation.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
